(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Poetry: The City at Night.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising understanding metaphors and personification in a poem.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Read the poem.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Read the poem about a city at night.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Metaphor and personification.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A metaphor says one thing is another. Personification gives human actions or feelings to something that is not human.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Is \"Its streetlights blink their tired eyes\" a metaphor, personification, or both?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Streetlights are compared to eyes, without \"like\" or \"as\". That is a metaphor.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Tired\" and \"blink\" are human things. That is personification.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "So it is both.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"The city is a sleeping giant.\" What kind of language is this?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Metaphor": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Simile": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Rhyme": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A fact": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Does it use \"like\" or \"as\"?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It says the city IS a giant.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Saying one thing is another is a…": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It says the city is a giant, without \"like\" or \"as\", so it is a metaphor.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which line uses personification?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The wind whispers down the empty roads": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The city at night": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "In rows": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Across the skies": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Look for something that is not human doing a human action.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Can wind really whisper?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Whispering is something people do.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The wind is given a human action: whispering.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What does \"morning is a golden blanket\" suggest?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Warm sunlight spreading over the city": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Someone bought a gold blanket": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "It is cold in the morning": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The city is asleep forever": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What colour is early sunlight?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A blanket covers and warms.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think of sunlight covering the buildings.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Golden sunlight spreads over the city like a warm blanket.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these lines: metaphor or personification?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A metaphor says something IS something else.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Personification gives human actions to things.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Can a moon keep watch? Can taxis feel weary?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The giant and the blanket are metaphors. The moon keeping watch and weary taxis are personification.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What mood does the poem create?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Calm and peaceful": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Angry and loud": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Scary and dangerous": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Rushed and busy": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about the words: sleeping, tired, whispers, rest.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Is the city busy or quiet at night?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The night city is resting.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Words like sleeping, whispers and rest create a calm, peaceful mood.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What helped you most?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Picturing the city": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Asking \"is it really…?\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Comparing with similes": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Poets use figurative language to help us see ordinary things in new ways.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The City at Night (a 2to.iQ poem)": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The city is a sleeping giant,Its streetlights blink their tired eyes.The wind whispers down the empty roads,And the moon keeps watch across the skies.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "The taxis rest their weary wheels,The tall towers stand guard in rows,And morning is a golden blanketThat wakes the city as it grows.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Metaphor. saying one thing is another thing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Personification. giving human actions to things that are not human.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Weary. very tired.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"the city is a sleeping giant\" means the big city is quiet at night.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"streetlights blink their tired eyes\" means the streetlights flicker.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"the wind whispers\" means the wind makes a soft sound.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"the moon keeps watch\" means the moon shines all night.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"the taxis rest their weary wheels\" means the taxis are parked and not driving.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"morning is a golden blanket\" means the morning sunlight spreads over the city.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
